\ Test that AOT inline PIC type checks work for polymorphic dispatch.
\ The interpreter seeds PIC entries during freeze; the AOT compiler
\ emits inline tag checks at generic call sites and dispatches via
\ jitPicDispatch on a hit.

add-nums: ( a b -- c ) [ + ] ;
mul-nums: ( a b -- c ) [ * ] ;
cmp: ( a b -- ? ) [ = ] ;

\ Fixnum pairs: PIC-eligible, seeded during freeze
1 2 add-nums .
3 4 mul-nums .
5 5 cmp .

\ Float pairs: separate PIC entry
1.5 2.5 add-nums .
2.0 3.0 mul-nums .
4.0 4.0 cmp .

\ Mixed: exercises the slow path when PIC misses
3 2.5 add-nums .
